<title>HONG KONG: Hainan Pearl loses 187mln yuan in 1996.</title>
<headline>Hainan Pearl loses 187mln yuan in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hainan Pearl River Enterprises Holdings Co Ltd recorded a net loss of 186.52 million yuan in 1996, the Shenzhen Stock Exchange said in a notice after the market closed on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
